picobus is the hub for picoclaw agents: a UNIX-socket bus, a FastCGI
web handler, and the web UI, including first-run signup.

Agents join by connecting to /var/run/picoclaw/hub.sock and sending a
register message. State lives in /var/picobus. picobus-pico (optional)
holds a native Pico WebSocket to each gateway and translates hub NDJSON
to message.send / message.create. PicoClaw never speaks hub NDJSON.

Another system can run this without becoming Daemon Crew.
